        summary {Get a list of high speed IO cells in the current design.}
        synopsis {all_hsios ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Returns all High Speed IO cell objects declared in the current design, which can be assigned to a variable or passed into another command. The list can be narrowed with the filter command using properties of the HSIO cells, which report_property and list_property enumerate. The command is scoped hierarchically from the level of the current instance, which is the top of the design unless current_instance says otherwise.}
        returns {List of hsio cell objects.}
        example {set_false_path -from [all_hsios] -to [all_registers]}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2026.1}
