    hover {
        summary {Get a list of RAM cells in the current design.}
        synopsis {all_rams ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Returns all RAM cell objects present in the current instance, including block RAMs, block RAM FIFOs, and distributed RAMs, which can be assigned to a variable or passed into another command. The list can be narrowed with the filter command using properties of the RAM cells. The command is scoped hierarchically from the level of the current instance, which is the top of the design unless current_instance says otherwise.}
        returns {List of ram cell objects.}
        example {filter [all_rams] {PRIMITIVE_SUBGROUP == fifo}}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2026.1}
