        synopsis {create_bd_intf_tlm_port -vlnv vlnv -mode mode ?-quiet? ?-verbose? name}
        description {Creates a new transaction-level modeling (TLM) interface port with the given name, VLNV, and interface mode in the current IP integrator subsystem design.}
