        summary {Delete a set of existing configurable report objects.}
        synopsis {delete_report_configs ?-quiet? ?-verbose? report_configs}
        description {Removes the specified report objects, created by the create_report_config command, from the current project. The reports must be specified as objects returned by get_report_configs.}
