        summary {Generate reports in parallel.}
        synopsis {generate_parallel_reports ?-quiet? ?-verbose? reports}
        description {Parallelizes the report generation tasks of the implementation phase, taking a list of report commands, configurations, and file names. The tool checks the interdependency of the requested reports and manages their generation, so the list can be supplied without regard to which reports must run sequentially, which run in parallel, and which are limited to two threads.}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2026.1}
    }
}
