        description {Generates the output products for the peripheral object created by create_peripheral. The output products are written to the IP repository location specified when the IP was created, under the name of the IP as given at creation. The peripheral should be captured in a Tcl variable at creation time so that it can be passed to this and other related commands.}
        example {generate_peripheral -driver -bfm_example_design \
   -enable_interrupt $perifObj}
