        summary {Generate VCD ports for the instance.}
        synopsis {generate_vcd_ports ?-quiet? ?-verbose? scope}
        description {Opens a VCD file handle for writing the port activity of the design unit instance named by the scope hierarchy path, creating a dumpports.vcd file that is populated when simulation is run for that scope. The XSim simulator must be up and running. The file is read by the create_testbench command to obtain the port activity for writing stimuli source.}
