        description {Gets a list of the various component modes defined on the current board, as defined in the Board Interface file. A component mode defines one of the modes of operation that a component on the board may have, along with the interfaces and preferred IP of that mode. The default search pattern is the wildcard *, or .* when -regexp is specified.}
