        description {Returns the ILA data objects in the Vivado logic analyzer. The upload_hw_ila_data command creates a hw_ila_data object while moving captured data from the ILA debug core on the physical device, and read_hw_ila_data creates one from an ILA data file on disk; the object can be viewed with display_hw_ila_data and written to disk with write_hw_ila_data. This command returns a list of available hardware ILA data objects, or returns an error if it fails.}
        returns {Hardware ILA data.}
        example {get_hw_ila_datas -of_objects [get_hw_ilas]}
