        description {Returns the serial I/O analyzer scan objects for the IBERT debug core. To analyze the margin of a given link it is often helpful to run a scan of the link using the specialized Eye Scan hardware of UltraScale devices or 7 series FPGAs, and the Vivado serial I/O analyzer lets you create, run, and save link scans. This command returns one or more hw_sio_scan objects, or returns an error if the command fails.}
        returns {Hardware SIO scans.}
        example {get_hw_sio_scans}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2026.1}
