        description {Returns the nibbles, or half-bytes, on the I/O banks of the current UltraScale device. On UltraScale devices the I/O bank hierarchy adds byte groups and nibbles to the 7 series division into I/O banks and package pins: each pkgpin_bytegroup has an upper and a lower nibble, and each pkgpin_nibble has 6 or 7 pins.}
        returns {A list of pin_nibble objects.}
        example {get_pkgpin_nibbles -of [get_iobanks 44] -filter {TYPE == U}}
