        summary {Get wave objects from a wave configuration.}
        synopsis {get_waves ?-of wave_container? ?-regexp? ?-nocase? ?-filter expression? ?-recursive? ?-long_name? ?-short_name? ?-quiet? ?-verbose? patterns}
        description {Gets the wave objects of a wave configuration, group, or virtual bus that match the given patterns, which name the design objects from which wave objects are created.}
