        summary {Imports the given XST project file.}
        synopsis {import_xst ?-copy_sources? ?-quiet? ?-verbose? file}
        description {Imports XST synthesis project files into the current project, including the various source files used in the XST run. The default is to reference source files from their current location.}
        returns {List of file objects that were imported from the XST file.}
