        synopsis {refresh_hw_vio ?-update_output_values? ?-quiet? ?-verbose? hw_vios}
        description {Reads the signal values at the input probes of the specified VIO debug cores on the device and updates the INPUT_VALUE and ACTIVITY_VALUE properties of the corresponding hw_probe objects. The hw_vio objects can be specified by name or as objects returned by get_hw_vios; -update_output_values is the reverse of commit_hw_vio, which applies the probe OUTPUT_VALUE to the core.}
        returns {Nothing.}
        example {refresh_hw_vio -update_output_values hw_vio_1}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2026.1}
