        summary {Reimport files when they are found out-of-date.}
        synopsis {reimport_files ?-force? ?-quiet? ?-verbose? ?files?}
        description {Reimports project files, updating the local project files from the original referenced source files. If no files are specified, all out-of-date files in the project are reimported, and with -force and no files every file in the project is reimported.}
        returns {List of file objects that were imported.}
        example {reimport_files -force}
