        summary {Report formatted hardware MIG calibration status and margin data.}
        synopsis {report_hw_mig ?-file file_name? ?-append? ?-return_string? ?-quiet? ?-verbose? hw_objects}
        description {Reports formatted information on memory IP hardware configuration, calibration, and margin, without the graphical margin scan plots available in the Vivado logic analyzer or Vivado Lab Edition. Memory controllers implemented in a design are associated with hw_mig objects, and the inputs can be any hw_mig, hw_device, hw_target, or hw_server object specified with the appropriate get_hw_* command rather than by name.}
        returns {The reported data, or an error if it fails.}
        example {report_hw_mig -file C:/Data/hw_mig_report.txt [get_hw_migs]}
