    hover {
        summary {Report Versal soft memory controller (Soft MC) configuration, calibration, and margin data.}
        synopsis {report_hw_softmc ?-file file_name? ?-append? ?-return_string? ?-quiet? ?-verbose? hw_objects}
        description {Reports formatted information on memory IP hardware configuration, calibration, and margin, without the graphical margin scan plots available in the Vivado logic analyzer or Vivado Lab Edition. Versal soft memory controllers implemented in a design are associated with hw_softmc objects, as returned by get_hw_softmcs, and let the calibration and the read and write window margins of a memory interface design be verified.}
        returns {The reported data, or an error if it fails.}
        example {report_hw_softmc -file C:/Data/softmc_report.txt [get_hw_softmcs]}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2026.1}
