        synopsis {report_io ?-file file_name? ?-name name? ?-append? ?-format format? ?-return_string? ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Reports the details of the IO banks of the current design, including device specific information such as the target part, package, and speed grade, as well as information related to each pin on the device.}
        returns {Report.}
