        summary {Set logic unconnected for output ports and output pins.}
        synopsis {set_logic_unconnected ?-quiet? ?-verbose? objects}
        description {Defines the specified list of output ports and output pins as unconnected. This command operates silently and does not return direct feedback of its operation.}
        returns {Nothing.}
