        summary {Show objects in the Find Results view.}
        synopsis {show_objects ?-name tab_title? ?-quiet? ?-verbose? objects}
        description {Populates the specified design objects into the Find Results window in the Vivado IDE. The objects must be specified as design objects, as returned by commands like get_cells, get_pins, get_nets, all_inputs, or all_rams, and not just by name. Running the command repeatedly without -name overwrites the prior results, and in Tcl or Batch mode the command simply returns without error or comment.}
