        description {Unmarks the specified objects that were previously marked by the mark_objects command, for use in GUI mode. The color options are not necessary to unmark a specific object, but can be used to unmark all objects currently marked in the specified color; if no objects are specified, all marked objects of the specified color are unmarked, and if no color is specified, all marked objects are unmarked.}
        returns {Nothing.}
