        summary {Update the design checkpoints by adding the generated software parameter info files to them.}
        synopsis {update_sw_parameters ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Updates the design checkpoints with the latest hardware def, which carries the updated software parameter information. When a software parameter of an IP is modified the runs need not go stale, but already generated design checkpoints must be updated with the modified parameter information captured in the hwdef file.}
