        description {Checks the board.xml, part0_pins.xml and preset.xml files in the given directory, which is only supported for board XML files with schema_version 2.0 or later. If a project is open and an IP repository is loaded, certain IP and interface attributes used in the board definition are also validated against the current IP repository.}
        returns {Ok if all board files are valid.}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2026.1}
