        synopsis {wait_on_hw_sio_sweep ?-timeout timeout? hw_sio_sweeps ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Suspends a Tcl script or Tcl command processing after run_hw_sio_sweep until the serial I/O analyzer sweep scan is complete, after which processing continues. The hw_sio_sweep objects must be specified as objects returned by create_hw_sio_sweep or get_hw_sio_sweeps (required).}
        returns {Nothing if successful; an error if it fails.}
