        summary {Export package pin and port placement information.}
        synopsis {write_csv ?-force? file ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Writes the package pin and port placement information of the current design into a comma separated value (CSV) file, whose format and requirements are described in the Vivado Design Suite User Guide: I/O and Clock Planning (UG899).}
        returns {Name of the output file.}
        example {write_csv C:/Data/pinList.csv}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2026.1}
