        description {Writes the hw_sio_sweep object populated by run_hw_sio_sweep to disk, creating a directory holding the multiple scan files produced by the sweep, which is a collection of link scans run across a range of GT configuration settings. The hw_sio_sweep must be specified as an object returned by get_hw_sio_sweeps.}
